\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Texas Judge Blocks State  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Ban Against Women With Health Risks; Court says women facing life-threatening emergencies have been improperly denied abortions in state\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto \par \uc2 434 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 August 2023\par 11:52 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 A Texas judge blocked the state from enforcing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans against women facing serious pregnancy complications, saying physicians unsure of how to interpret the law have been withholding essential medical care.\par \par \uc2 The decision was a victory for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights groups in a state with some of the country's strictest \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws. The case {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-women-denied-abortions-testify-about-impact-of-state-bans-999b8cff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 featured emotional testimony }}}\uc2  in a two-day hearing from women who had been denied abortions and suffered sepsis, been forced to travel out of state and watched a baby born gasping for air, only to die within hours. It was the first time since the \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-dobbs-year-after-roe-support-politics-d1ef5a5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2  that women provided hours of testimony in front of a judge about the emotional and physical impact of being denied an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  because of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a state ban }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Texas law already contains exceptions allowing physicians to provide abortions in life-threatening emergencies. But Judge Jessica Mangrum said that lack of clarity about how to interpret the law had caused physicians to withhold care from the women suing.\par \par \uc2 Mangrum said that an equality provision of the Texas constitution protects the right of women to receive such care in order to alleviate a risk of death or risk to their health, including their fertility.\par \par \uc2 Mangrum also found that SB 8, a law passed in late 2021 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-abortion-law-what-to-know-as-supreme-court-allows-it-to-take-effect-11630606238"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allows private lawsuits }}}\uc2  against anyone who provides an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks of pregnancy, violates the Texas constitution.\par \par \uc2 Texas First Assistant Attorney General Brent Webster said his office had filed an appeal directly to the Texas Supreme Court, calling the lower court ruling "an activist Austin judge's attempt to override Texas \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws."\par \par \uc2 The win for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights groups is nonetheless both narrow and potentially fleeting. Most abortions will remain banned in the state. Under Texas civil procedure, the judge's decision is automatically stayed once the state appeals.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights supporters do have some record of success on this issue even in conservative states such as North Dakota and Oklahoma, which have recognized a narrow right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in their state constitutions in medical emergencies.\par \par \uc2 Texas has responded to the suit saying that any delays in medical care these women experienced were the result of decisions by individual doctors, not state officials. No provider has been prosecuted for providing an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a medical emergency in Texas, state attorneys said in court.\par \par \uc2 Write to Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230805ej850005l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
