\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 GOP Rivals on Mission to Pry Evangelical Voters Away From Trump; Evangelicals have stuck by the former president through controversies\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alex Leary and John McCormick \par \uc2 1,245 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 June 2023\par 20:23 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14\uc2 Mike Pence\uc2  called for a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. Asa Hutchinson quoted Scripture, soon to be outdone by Francis Suarez who cited two Bible passages and said his parents met at a pro-life rally. And Tim Scott walked on stage and declared, "I see people just like me who have faith on their sleeve, Jesus in their heart."\par \par \uc2 A game of spiritual one-upmanship played out here Friday as many of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/sizing-up-the-2024-republican-primary-field-db34a150?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2024 Republican presidential candidates }}}\uc2  appeared before a crowd of religious activists.\par \par \uc2 All of them are trying to solve a puzzle: How {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/a-top-man-of-god-in-iowa-wants-someone-other-than-trump-1280461b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to pull evangelical voters away }}}\uc2  from a twice-divorced, crude-talking New Yorker who rarely goes to church and isn't known for his ability {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8EIgHsGZAmk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to quote Bible verses }}}\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/topics/person/donald-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 So far, none of them seems to have figured it out.\par \par \uc2 Trump, who doesn't speak to the Faith & Freedom Coalition gathering until Saturday night, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/trump-desantis-and-negativity-dominate-early-2024-gop-campaign-ads-92cd2fd3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was the clear favorite }}}\uc2  Friday, evidenced by the eruption of applause when North Carolina Lt. Gov. Mark Robinson said he was endorsing the former president. "The nation is at war," he said, "and we need a warrior."\par \par \uc2 Evangelicals in 2016 overlooked Trump's foibles {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/evangelicals-back-donald-trump-in-record-numbers-despite-earlier-doubts-1478689372"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to embrace him }}}\uc2  as an almost divine figure\u8212\'20\'14some believe he was sent by God\u8212\'20\'14whose policies and Supreme Court picks often promoted their priorities. That lasting support undergirds the former president's front-runner status in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/next-question-for-gop-2024-trump-challengers-when-to-drop-out-794a6d38?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2024 nomination chase }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "No man is going to be perfect, but he carried our agenda," said attendee Nelson Amaya Jr., 28, of Baltimore. "We know Trump, we know how he works."\par \par \uc2 Rivals Friday and Saturday at a Washington hotel are trying to land a tricky argument: I can give you everything Trump did, without controversies.\par \par \uc2 "There's no road to the nomination that doesn't go through this community," said \uc2 Ralph Reed\uc2 , chairman of the Faith and Freedom Coalition. "If I'm one of the candidates polling in single digits or low double digits this weekend, I want to make a very strong impression and generate a buzz."\par \par \uc2 Gov. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/topics/person/ron-desantis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ron DeSantis }}}\uc2  of Florida was the most anticipated candidate Friday and drew a standing ovation. He ticked through his legislative wins in Florida and battles against Covid restrictions and "woke" \uc2 Walt Disney Co\uc2 . He only briefly mentioned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and didn't overtly mention Trump, suggesting to voters the former president is responsible for the party's losing streak.\par \par \uc2 "In Florida we have created a culture of winning," DeSantis said. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich480\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal7200
