\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Indiana  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Doctor Fined for Violating Privacy of 10-Year-Old Patient; State medical board said doctor shouldn't have spoken publicly about case\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto \par \uc2 461 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 May 2023\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 An Indiana medical board late Thursday disciplined a doctor who spoke to a journalist about an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  she performed on a 10-year-old Ohio rape victim, a case that grabbed national attention in the early days after the \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court\uc2  overturned Roe v. Wade.\par \par \uc2 The medical board fined obstetrician-gynecologist Dr. Caitlin Bernard $3,000 and issued a letter of reprimand.\par \par \uc2 Bernard spoke to a reporter from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.indystar.com/story/news/health/2022/07/01/indiana-abortion-law-roe-v-wade-overturned-travel/7779936001/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Indianapolis Star }}}\uc2  last summer after Ohio enacted a ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after about six weeks of pregnancy. The new law, she told the newspaper, had forced the young girl to travel to Indiana, where the procedure was still legal, to obtain the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Indiana Attorney General \uc2 Todd Rokita\uc2 , a Republican, brought a case against the doctor before the state's medical licensing board, arguing that she had violated patient privacy laws by discussing the girl's situation and had failed to properly report the suspected child abuse to law enforcement. "This case was about patient privacy and the trust between the doctor and patient that was broken," Rokita said in a statement on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Testifying at the hearing, Bernard said she followed her university hospital system's policy on reporting suspected child abuse to a social worker and that the information she shared with a reporter wasn't protected by privacy laws. "There was no information that I released that led to her being identified," she said.\par \par \uc2 The board determined that Bernard had followed proper procedures in reporting the incident to the authorities but that she had violated patient privacy rules by providing details that might have allowed the patient to be identified. Bernard is one of the few complex family planning specialists in Indiana who provides \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to patients with difficult medical situations. Board members expressed concern that imposing harsher penalties on the doctor, including probation, would force patients in need of that type of care to travel to other states.\par \par \uc2 Indiana's state legislature passed a near-total ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  last August, but {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the law is currently blocked in the courts.  }}}\par \par \uc2 Since the Supreme Court ended the constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  last June, states around the U.S. have enacted laws imposing potentially serious penalties for doctors who perform abortions, including imprisonment. Few doctors have faced penalties thus far for performing abortions in states with bans. Bernard's case was unique and the penalties she received relatively minor, but it has drawn attention to the increased legal risks to doctors in the current politically charged environment around \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230526ej5q003pd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
