\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Trump Speaks to Wide Audience at CNN Town Hall, Sticks to Narrow Message; From guns to  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  to 2020 election and Jan. 6, former president appeals to GOP base voters\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alex Leary and John McCormick \par \uc2 985 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 May 2023\par 19:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Former President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  reveled in the opportunity to reach a broader audience Wednesday night with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/trump-loss-in-sexual-abuse-case-casts-another-legal-cloud-over-2024-bid-a86846af?mod=hp_lead_pos5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a prime-time appearance on CNN }}}\uc2 , but he didn't broaden his message.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trump's punchy performance in a live town hall thrilled supporters, repelled his critics\u8212\'20\'14who questioned whether he could win a general election with such a message\u8212\'20\'14and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/donald-trump-tops-ron-desantis-in-test-of-gop-presidential-field-wsj-poll-finds-88c84663"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 underscored his front-runner claim }}}\uc2  to the 2024 Republican presidential nomination. That it came in New Hampshire, where the first Republican primary will be held early next year, may only advance that goal.\par \par \uc2 The Trump campaign's strategy in\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/how-donald-trump-and-cnn-found-each-other-again-66c9c85c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 returning to a network }}}\uc2  he has long attacked, people familiar with the issue said, was centered on the idea that he would perform well in a town-hall setting, and that he should court audiences beyond conservative media outlets. That goal included reaching moderate Republicans and swing voters, particularly women, he would need to win a general election.\par \par \uc2 According to Nielsen data released Thursday, CNN's town hall averaged 3.1 million total viewers, easily beating Fox News Channel and MSNBC during the time period.\par \par \uc2 Those viewers were met with his false and repeated claims that the 2020 election was rigged, a vow to pardon "a large portion" of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/four-proud-boys-found-guilty-of-seditious-conspiracy-f967f523"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Jan. 6, 2021, Capitol rioters }}}\uc2  and a mocking denial of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/donald-trump-found-liable-in-e-jean-carroll-civil-case-ordered-to-pay-5-million-for-sexual-abuse-and-defamation-25e175b9?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the sexual-abuse case }}}\uc2  the former president just lost\u8212\'20\'14a moment that drew laughter from some in the audience, which consisted of Republicans and undeclared voters who plan to take part in New Hampshire's GOP primary. Mr. Trump stayed to the right on guns and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and refused to say whether he wants to see Ukraine prevail in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/zelensky-says-ukraine-needs-more-time-before-launching-counteroffensive-55b36d6d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 its war with Russia }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 His fans enjoyed the show. "President Trump went into the lion's den and he came out victorious," Texas Rep. Lance Gooden tweeted. Arizona Rep. Andy Biggs said, "President Trump dominated CNN tonight. He remains America's leader."\par \par \uc2 Republican critics of Mr. Trump were again forced to reckon with his hold on the party. "He had a chance to move on from 2020. He didn't do it. He had a chance to own some of the issues of January 6th, what his role there was. He didn't do it," New Hampshire Gov. \uc2 Chris Sununu\uc2  said on CNN following the event.\par \par \uc2 "So, if you are an independent voter, if you're a suburban mom, all these voters that Republicans are trying to bring back into the mix, I don't see any of them being convinced by anything because it was just kind of a same old regurgitation," added Mr. Sununu, who is considering an entry into the presidential race. President Biden {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/graphics/votecast-2020/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 beat Mr. Trump in 2020 by 19 percentage points }}}\uc2  among suburban women and by 12 points among all women, according to the AP VoteCast survey.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Trump has long upended political norms and time and again defied predictions of his decline. Some recent polls show him narrowly leading a hypothetical rematch with Mr. Biden, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/biden-faces-rough-month-as-debt-talks-potential-border-surge-loom-579cfad5?mod=Searchresults_pos1&page=1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 who is struggling }}}\uc2  with questions about his age, stubborn inflation and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/migrant-influx-overwhelms-southern-border-as-title-42-winds-down-da4e1e99"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a southern border crisis }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 At times Wednesday night, Mr. Trump did talk about his record in office and criticized some of the president's policies. A statement from his campaign after the event said Mr. Trump "laid out his vision to reverse the Biden Decline starting on Day One."\par \par \uc2 More often, though, that was overshadowed by his appeals to a conservative audience and his pugnacious style. "You're a nasty person," {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/cnns-trump-town-hall-puts-kaitlan-collins-on-big-stage-as-network-takes-heat-849977eb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 he told CNN host }}}\uc2  Kaitlan Collins. Given a chance to weigh in on Florida Gov. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/disney-says-desantis-allies-are-weaponizing-the-power-of-government-eab0e30b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 battle with Walt Disney Co. }}}\uc2 , a subject that has made free-market Republicans uncomfortable, he dodged with a boast of his strength over his expected rival.\par \par \uc2 A super PAC supporting Mr. DeSantis said Mr. Trump spent his time talking about the past, including "his defense of his comments about grabbing women by their genitals" and "the federal investigation into his stash of taxpayer-owned classified documents at Mar-a-Lago\u8230\'20\'26How does this Make America Great Again?"\par \par \uc2 Former Arkansas Gov. Asa Hutchinson, a declared GOP presidential candidate, said on CNN: "He had a weak performance and he's locked in the past. He had a goal, I'm sure, to expand his base, to be able to prove that he can attract independents and suburban votes. He failed that test."\par \par \uc2 When an audience member asked what he would say to women worried about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 last year's U.S. Supreme Court decision }}}\uc2  overturning the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Mr. Trump told her the decision was a great victory and bragged about his role in nominating conservative justices to the high court. At the same time, he refused to say whether he would sign a federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 Asked about the spate of mass shootings around the country, he declined to identify any new gun restrictions he would sign and spoke instead of arming teachers. "It's not the gun that pulls the trigger. It's the person that pulls the trigger," he said.\par \par \uc2 Those answers on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and guns are pleasing to conservatives, but not necessarily swing voters, recent polling shows.\par \par \uc2 "Trump seized this unique opportunity to try and win a showdown with CNN by repeating his existing narratives rather than focusing on the future," said GOP strategist Ron Bonjean. "There was little expectation that this conversation was actually going to be productive and it felt much more like a sensational Jerry Springer episode."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden, in response to the broadcast, tweeted: "It's simple, folks. Do you want four more years of that?"\par \par \uc2 Write to Alex Leary at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:alex.leary@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alex.leary@wsj.com }}}\uc2  and John McCormick at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:mccormick.john@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mccormick.john@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230511ej5b001xh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
