\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Nikki Haley Tells Republicans to Take Pragmatic Approach on  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 ; GOP presidential candidate calls for greater effort for consensus on divisive issue\b0\par\par\uc2 By John McCormick \par \uc2 960 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 April 2023\par 23:56 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Corrections & Amplifications\par \par \uc2 Nikki Haley's husband is named Michael Haley. An earlier version of this article misspelled Mr. Haley's first name as Micheal. (Corrected on April 25)\par \par \uc2 Nikki Haley, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/nikki-haley-starts-gop-presidential-bid-with-focus-on-winning-south-carolina-30af34a0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 only woman in the 2024 Republican presidential field }}}\uc2 , called for her party to be more pragmatic in its approach to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and to work harder to find consensus with Democrats in an effort to reduce frequency of the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Her remarks on Tuesday were delivered just hours before Democratic Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  spoke to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights supporters a few miles north at her alma mater, \uc2 Howard University\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The pairing, on the day President Biden {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/joe-biden-2024-presidential-re-election-campaign-87ef002b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched his re-election bid }}}\uc2 , underscores the importance of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  heading into the 2024 campaign. Democrats are embracing it as a motivating issue for their voters, while Republicans\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/trump-other-gop-2024-hopefuls-struggle-to-define-abortion-message-71fed983"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are struggling to balance }}}\uc2  the demands of social conservatives with the concerns of swing voters needed to win general elections.\par \par \uc2 In her speech at the headquarters of Susan B. Anthony Pro-Life America in suburban Washington, Ms. Haley {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.c-span.org/video/?527634-1/nikki-haley-remarks-abortion-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested a limited federal role }}}\uc2  in setting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules, with most decisions at the state level.\par \par \uc2 "Different people in different places are taking different paths," she said. "That's what the founders of our country envisioned. It's the reality of living in a democracy."\par \par \uc2 Ms. Haley, a former South Carolina governor and United Nations ambassador, also said both parties should agree that "contraception should be more available, not less."\par \par \uc2 Ms. Harris pointed to the push among some Republicans to ban abortions beyond six weeks of pregnancy, as she argued that the GOP is promoting extreme positions that infringe upon the freedoms of Americans.\par \par \uc2 "Clearly, most of them don't even know how a woman's body works," she said. "Cause most women don't even know they're pregnant at that stage of a pregnancy."\par \par \uc2 Last year, the Supreme Court ended the federal right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and left the matter to the states. Some have moved to rein in \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access, with state and federal lawmakers weighing additional restrictions. State legislation has ranged from total bans to sharply tightening the legal window for terminating a pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Haley said any efforts at the federal level would have to be modest, as Republicans are unlikely to both control the White House and have large enough majorities in Congress to pass more aggressive restrictions. Congressional Democrats support broad access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We have to face this reality: the pro-life laws that have passed in strongly Republican states will not be approved at the federal level," she said, while shying away from specifics.\par \par \uc2 As governor, Ms. Haley signed into law a ban on most abortions after 20 weeks, with no exceptions for rape or incest.\par \par \uc2 Other candidates in the party's still emerging 2024 presidential field have offered varying approaches. Former President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , the party's current nomination front-runner, has expressed opposition to any federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law and called for state-level decisions. Florida Gov. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , who is expected to soon enter the race, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gov-ron-desantis-signs-florida-six-week-abortion-ban-b18029cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier this month signed legislation }}}\uc2  that bans most abortions in his state after six weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 A Wall Street Journal poll conducted April 11-17 found a majority of voters {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/donald-trump-tops-ron-desantis-in-test-of-gop-presidential-field-wsj-poll-finds-88c84663"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 opposed a six-week \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban }}}\uc2 , 53% to 41%. While eight in 10 Democrats and 56% of independent voters are opposed, 71% of Republicans support the restriction.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Haley described how her husband, Michael Haley, was adopted from parents who lived in poverty and might have taken another direction when it came to his birth. She also described her own struggles, including numerous surgeries and fertility treatments, to become pregnant with the two children she had.\par \par \uc2 In making her case that more consensus on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is possible, Ms. Haley pointed to the 2015 mass shooting at Mother Emanuel African Methodist Episcopal Church in Charleston, S.C., where a white gunman's killing of nine Black people at a Bible study class prompted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/confederate-battle-flag-to-be-removed-from-south-carolina-capitol-1436454888"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 removal of the Confederate flag }}}\uc2  from the South Carolina State House after years of controversy.\par \par \uc2 "What was true then, with the flag, can be true now, with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," she said. "This shouldn't be about one movement winning, and another one losing. This shouldn't be about picking sides, scoring points, or stoking outrage. It's about saving babies and supporting moms."\par \par \uc2 GOP strategists and party leaders have increasingly expressed concern that the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  issue is hurting the party at the ballot box. In a speech last week in California, \uc2 Republican National Committee\uc2  Chairwoman \uc2 Ronna McDaniel\uc2  called for a party message closer to what's most widely supported by voters.\par \par \uc2 "Polling shows that when the choice is between a Democrat who wants zero \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions and a Republican who supports protecting life at 15 weeks, we win by 22 points," she said.\par \par \uc2 Susan B. Anthony\uc2  Pro-Life America has said it would oppose any presidential candidate who doesn't back "at a minimum" a 15-week national standard.\par \par \uc2 Republican Sen. Tim Scott of South Carolina, who has created a presidential exploratory committee, has avoided specifics when asked whether he supports a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, telling NBC News he would sign "the most conservative, pro-life legislation that they can get through Congress" should he become president.\par \par \uc2 Former Vice President \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2 , who has said he is close to making a decision on a potential bid, has said he supports a federal ban after 15 weeks of pregnancy and disagreed with Mr. Trump that the matter should be left to the states.\par \par \uc2 Write to John McCormick at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:mccormick.john@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mccormick.john@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230425ej4p0048t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
