\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Supreme Court Lets  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Pill Remain on Market, for Now; Justice Department had asked high court to preserve access to widely used  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  pill\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jess Bravin and Laura Kusisto \par \uc2 1,162 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 April 2023\par 22:36 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14The Supreme Court temporarily blocked lower court orders that would have limited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-access-case-texas-judge-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 access to the \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  drug mifepristone }}}\uc2  beginning Saturday, preserving the pill's availability while the justices weigh the Biden administration's emergency request to leave current \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  approvals in place during a continuing legal battle with antiabortion groups.\par \par \uc2 In a pair of orders Friday, Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 , who oversees emergency matters for the lower courts that limited or suspended approval of the widely used \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, gave the antiabortion groups until noon Tuesday to file briefs in response to appeals by the \uc2 FDA\uc2  and Danco Laboratories LLC, which makes the branded version Mifeprex.\par \par \uc2 The temporary orders expire at 11:59 p.m. Wednesday, suggesting a high court decision on whether and to what extent mifepristone will remain available during litigation may come by then.\par \par \uc2 Antiabortion plaintiffs are challenging both the \uc2 FDA\uc2 's 2000 approval of mifepristone and subsequent regulations starting in 2016 that relaxed the stringent conditions for the drug's administration, such as a requirement for three in-person doctor visits.\par \par \uc2 A late Wednesday order from the Fifth U.S. Circuit Court of Appeals in New Orleans {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/appeals-court-rules-abortion-pill-mifepristone-can-remain-temporarily-available-912b03ad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rolled back mifepristone access }}}\uc2  to the pre-2016 regulations, which limited its use to women pregnant for seven or fewer weeks, required three in-person doctor visits to receive and barred sending to patients through the mail.\par \par \uc2 That decision partially blocked an opinion the previous Friday by a federal district judge in Amarillo, Texas, Matthew Kacsmaryk, that would take the drug off the market {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-approval-suspended-by-u-s-judge-3c5c88cf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 by suspending its 2000 FDA approval }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Under current regulations, including some adopted during the coronavirus pandemic, mifepristone has been available to women up to 10 weeks pregnant, and they have been able to obtain prescriptions through telehealth appointments and have the medication sent by mail. By 2020, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than half of U.S. abortions }}}\uc2  were done with medication, according to the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2 , a research organization that supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. Mifepristone also has other uses, including for miscarriage management.\par \par \uc2 In the Biden administration's emergency appeal, U.S. Solicitor General \uc2 Elizabeth Prelogar\uc2  said the lower-court orders "would upend the regulatory regime for mifepristone, with sweeping consequences for the pharmaceutical industry, women who need access to the drug, and \uc2 FDA\uc2 's ability to implement its statutory authority."\par \par \uc2 Danco Laboratories in its petition said the lower-court rulings created "debilitating uncertainty for Danco that threatens its very existence."\par \par \uc2 Both filings pointed to a risk that sales of the pill could cease altogether in the coming days if the high court didn't at least put a pause on the lower-court orders.\par \par \uc2 An antiabortion lawsuit challenging mifepristone's approval should have been thrown out at the outset, the government said, because the plaintiffs' objection to the drug is based on opposition to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , not any harm they personally have suffered from its approval decades ago. The challengers, although they include doctors, "neither take nor prescribe mifepristone, and \uc2 FDA\uc2 's approval of the drug does not require them to do or refrain from doing anything," the government said.\par \par \uc2 The mifepristone case is the latest aftershock of the Supreme Court's 2022 decision rescinding \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights the justices had recognized in 1973. In {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 , which set out women's constitutional right to end pregnancy before fetal viability, the court said it was ending a 49-year effort to impose a nationwide settlement on a divisive question of public policy and personal morality.\par \par \uc2 "We do not pretend to know how our political system or society will respond to today's decision," Justice Alito wrote for the majority in Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization, but whatever that may be, "the authority to regulate \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  must be returned to the people and their elected representatives."\par \par \uc2 Dobbs's political impact was immediate, energizing both sides of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  debate. With a majority of Americans supporting access to the procedure, the Democratic Party's commitment to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights has been boosting its performance at the ballot box, retaining a majority in the \uc2 U.S. Senate\uc2  last November and seeing liberals {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/wisconsin-supreme-court-election-shows-abortion-continues-to-sway-voters-4e47297c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 take a 4-3 majority on the Wisconsin Supreme Court }}}\uc2  after this month's state election.\par \par \uc2 In the South and other areas where antiabortion views are more widespread, opponents of the procedure have redoubled efforts to restrict access. On Thursday, Florida's Republican-controlled legislature sent GOP Gov. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  a bill prohibiting women from obtaining {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/florida-abortion-ban-law-28c65d8c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 abortions after six weeks of pregnancy }}}\uc2 , which he signed hours later.\par \par \uc2 But if the Supreme Court thought it had washed its hands of the issue, the mifepristone case demonstrates that litigation will remain a central arena where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights are contested.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit, Alliance for Hippocratic Medicine v. \uc2 FDA\uc2 , was filed in November by a group of antiabortion doctors and healthcare organizations who allege the government's 2000 approval of mifepristone was so flawed that it must be voided now. Although they don't prescribe mifepristone themselves, they argued that the drug's approval in 2000 put them at risk of having to treat a patient who might suffer complications from its use.\par \par \uc2 By filing in Amarillo, the plaintiffs guaranteed that Judge Kacsmaryk, a Trump appointee who once worked for conservative Christian litigation group \uc2 First Liberty Institute\uc2 , would hear the case; he is the only district judge in the city's federal courthouse.\par \par \uc2 Judge Kacsmaryk's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.txnd.370067/gov.uscourts.txnd.370067.137.0_17.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 67-page decision }}}\uc2 , which said that mifepristone cannot have therapeutic benefit because pregnancy isn't an illness, was to take effect Friday absent appellate court intervention.\par \par \uc2 Almost immediately afterward, a federal judge in Spokane, Wash., Obama appointee Thomas Rice, issued an opinion at odds with the Amarillo order, preventing the \uc2 FDA\uc2  from changing access to mifepristone in the 17 states and the District of Columbia that had filed a suit arguing that current regulations on the drug's dispersal were more restrictive than federal law allows.\par \par \uc2 Judge Rice {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.waed.102225/gov.uscourts.waed.102225.91.0.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 clarified and reaffirmed his order }}}\uc2  Thursday, saying the agency had to abide by his ruling irrespective of the rulings in Texas and the Fifth Circuit.\par \par \uc2 Wednesday's decision from a divided three-judge panel of the Fifth Circuit found it was likely too late to contest the 2000 approval but left intact Judge Kacsmaryk's injunction of subsequent changes in regulations while litigation proceeded.\par \par \uc2 "We look forward to explaining why the \uc2 FDA\uc2  has not met its heavy burden to pause the parts of the district court's decision that restore the critical safeguards for women and girls that were unlawfully removed by the \uc2 FDA\uc2 ," said Erin Hawley, a lawyer with \uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2 , an advocacy group which represents the plaintiffs.\par \par \uc2 Liz Essley Whyte contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jess Bravin at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Jess.Bravin@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jess.Bravin@wsj.com }}}\uc2  and Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230414ej4e000mb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
