\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Biden Administration Asks Appeals Court to Halt  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 -Pill Ruling; Democratic-led states plan to stockpile widely used pill in case it is pulled from the market\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto and Liz Essley Whyte \par \uc2 1,048 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 April 2023\par 04:20 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Biden administration filed an emergency request Monday asking a federal appeals court to block a ruling that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-approval-suspended-by-u-s-judge-3c5c88cf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suspended approval of a widely used}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-approval-suspended-by-u-s-judge-3c5c88cf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pill}}}\uc2 , while some Democratic-led states announced contingency plans to stockpile \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  drugs.\par \par \uc2 In a filing with the New Orleans-based Fifth U.S. Circuit Court of Appeals, the Justice Department said a federal judge in Texas engaged in an "extraordinary and unprecedented" usurpation of the \uc2 U.S. Food and Drug Administration\uc2 's authority by ruling that the pill shouldn't have been approved.\par \par \uc2 The department said U.S. District Judge Matthew Kacsmaryk in Amarillo, Texas, upended decades of reliance on\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-access-case-texas-judge-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pill, known as mifepristone}}}\uc2 , "based on the court's own misguided assessment of the drug's safety."\par \par \uc2 The drug's brand-name manufacturer, Danco Laboratories, which sells mifepristone marketed as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/little-known-abortion-pill-maker-faces-scrutiny-11656939602?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mifeprex}}}\uc2 , filed a similar motion. The company said that in addition to the potential harm the ruling posed to millions of women who rely on the pill, it also threatened Danco's livelihood as a one-drug company.\par \par \uc2 Hundreds of pharmaceutical industry leaders, meanwhile, weighed in, saying in an open letter that the Texas decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-the-texas-courts-abortion-pill-ruling-means-for-fda-c117f015"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could threaten FDA regulation of medicines}}}\uc2  more broadly. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
