\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone is sold under the brand name Mifeprex and in a generic version. PHOTO: Angela Owens/The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 The developments came after healthcare providers, lawyers and advocates on both sides of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  issue spent the holiday weekend grappling with what could be another sea change in the national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  landscape, less than a year since the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Supreme Court removed constitutional protections}}}\uc2  for the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Judge Kacsmaryk in his Friday evening ruling said he would suspend the \uc2 FDA\uc2 's approval of the drug this Friday if a higher court didn't intervene. If his decision takes effect, it could cut off supplies of a drug that is the most common method for ending a pregnancy. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  approved mifepristone in 2000.\par \par \uc2 The Justice Department asked the Fifth Circuit to either delay the judge's decision for a longer period or rule on its emergency motion by Thursday, which would allow the administration to seek intervention from the Supreme Court if necessary.\par \par \uc2 Amid the legal maneuvering, Massachusetts and California announced they would be stockpiling \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills in an effort to ensure continued supply in their states even if a court ultimately orders the \uc2 FDA\uc2  to pull mifepristone off the market. The state of Washington announced a similar measure last week to purchase a three-year supply of the drug.\par \par \uc2 Even if Judge Kacsmaryk's ruling suspending mifepristone's approval takes effect, it wouldn't prevent states from using pill supplies already in their possession.\par \par \uc2 Gov. \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  said that California would be purchasing large quantities of misoprostol, the second in a two-drug regime typically used in medication abortions. Women can take misoprostol alone, but researchers say it is less effective and produces more severe side effects. The Democratic governor said California had already received more than 250,000 pills and has secured the right to buy up to two million to ensure continued supply in a rapidly shifting environment.\par \par \uc2 While at least a dozen states have banned most abortions since the Supreme Court overruled Roe v. Wade last June, the latest legal battle is noteworthy in that it also imperils \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in states where the procedure has remained legal. Clinics in those states already have been scrambling to cope with a surge in demand, and the potential loss of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill is likely to complicate those efforts.\par \par \uc2 Judge Kacsmaryk, an appointee of former President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , said in Friday's ruling that the \uc2 FDA\uc2  had failed to seriously consider legitimate safety questions about the drug, in violation of its statutory duty. He also said the agency used improper regulatory procedures in granting the drug approval.\par \par \uc2 The Justice Department's emergency motion Monday said those conclusions were incorrect. It also argued the judge made a series of other errors, including entertaining the lawsuit at all.\par \par \uc2 The plaintiffs in the lawsuit were antiabortion medical associations and individual physicians who said they were harmed by the drug because when women present with complications it strains the medical system and sometimes forces physicians to treat women with incomplete abortions despite their moral opposition to the procedure.\par \par \uc2 The department said none of the plaintiffs had standing to challenge the \uc2 FDA\uc2 's approval of a drug that they neither take nor prescribe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-abortion-pill-ruling-ignites-new-national-battle-a9c03329"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Texas decision's effects}}}\uc2  would be felt throughout the country because the pill is used not only in places where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal, but also potentially for miscarriage management in states where it isn't, the department said.\par \par \uc2 "If allowed to take effect, the court's order would thwart \uc2 FDA\uc2 's scientific judgment and severely harm women, particularly those for whom mifepristone is a medical or practical necessity," it said.\par \par \uc2 More than 400 drug executives, including \uc2 Pfizer Inc.\uc2  CEO \uc2 Albert Bourla\uc2  and \uc2 Biogen Inc.\uc2  President Alisha Alaimo, signed Monday's pharmaceutical industry letter criticizing Judge Kacsmaryk's ruling.\par \par \uc2 "If courts can overturn drug approvals without regard for science and evidence, or for the complexity required to fully vet the safety and efficacy of new drugs, any medicine is at risk for the same outcome of mifepristone," the letter read.\par \par \uc2 Complicating the legal landscape, a federal judge in Washington state on Friday issued a seemingly contradictory decision that could prevent the \uc2 FDA\uc2  from limiting sales of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill in 17 states and the District of Columbia that had sued the agency to preserve robust access.\par \par \uc2 In a separate filing Monday, the Justice Department asked that judge to clarify how his ruling interacts with the Texas decision, saying the two rulings appeared to be in "significant tension."\par \par \uc2 Danco also argued in its filing with the Fifth Circuit that the dueling decisions were a reason to delay implementation of any order to curtail access to the drug. "The public is understandably confused by these two orders, issued the same day," the company said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230410ej4a003xp\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
