\par\par \uc2 Review & Outlook (U.S.)\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 President \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  Strikes at \uc2 Walgreens\uc2 ; He punishes the drug store chain for abiding by other state  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  laws.\b0\par\par\uc2 By The Editorial Board \par \uc2 512 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 March 2023\par 23:49 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  said he doesn't plan to run for President in 2024, but the California Governor already seems to think he can dictate policy in the other 49 states. Consider his decision this week to punish \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  for complying with other state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws.\par \par \uc2 "California won't be doing business with @walgreens\u8212\'20\'14or any company that cowers to the extremists and puts women's lives at risk," Mr. Newsom tweeted on Monday. \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  isn't bowing to extremists. It's trying to navigate a complicated legal and political thicket after the Supreme Court's Dobbs decision last summer turned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulation back to the states.\par \par \uc2 At issue is the drug mifepristone, which is approved by the \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  to induce abortions during the first 10 weeks of pregnancy. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  in January eased its regulations to let patients obtain the drug directly from pharmacies rather than healthcare providers. Pharmacies will have to be specially certified to dispense the drug.\par \par \uc2 In other words, \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  and other retail pharmacies weren't even permitted until recently to dispense the drug under federal regulation. Now states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is restricted post-Dobbs argue that doctors cannot prescribe and pharmacies cannot dispense the drug under their laws. Many states also maintain stricter regulations on its dispensing than the \uc2 FDA\uc2  permits.\par \par \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  last week drew the fury of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  left when it said it wouldn't distribute the drug in some 20 states out of legal caution. This includes several states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal, but retail pharmacies aren't allowed to dispense the drug directly to patients. Pharmacists who violate the state laws can be punished with prison.\par \par \uc2 Enter Mr. Newsom, who on Monday vowed to bar \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  from doing business with the state, including potentially its vast Medicaid business unless it violated other state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws. \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  responded that it "plans to dispense mifepristone in any jurisdiction where it is legally permissible to do so" and "consistent with federal and state laws." Not good enough for Mr. Newsom.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday California gave \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  notice that it is withdrawing a contract renewal for its prison system. Liberals are comparing Mr. Newsom's retaliation against \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  to Florida Gov. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 's rescinding state regulatory and tax privileges for \uc2 Disney\uc2 . But unlike \uc2 Disney\uc2 , \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  has no special governing privileges from the state and didn't wade into a culture war. It was dragged into one.\par \par \uc2 Businesses make themselves targets when they take positions on political issues, but they don't deserve to be attacked for trying to comply with state and federal laws. This distinction is lost on Mr. Newsom, who wants to impose California's values on the rest of America. He's also banned travel by state employees to states with religious liberty protections.\par \par \uc2 Maybe he hopes that bullying businesses and other states will distract from California's problems. It's no wonder so many businesses are leaving the state.\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230310ej3a007vd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
