\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill has emerged as a new battleground between \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  supporters and opponents since the Supreme Court overturned Roe v. Wade. PHOTO: Michael Noble Jr. for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 Two new lawsuits challenge states' ability to restrict {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pills-to-be-available-more-widely-under-new-fda-rules-11672789765"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 access to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pills  }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 An obstetrician-gynecologist in North Carolina sued state officials tasked with enforcing restrictions on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-is-an-abortion-pill-leaked-supreme-court-decision-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pills  }}}\uc2 , saying the state can't limit access to the drugs beyond what federal health regulators designate.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit, filed in federal court in North Carolina on Wednesday, said federal laws and the Food and Drug Administration 's authority to regulate drugs trump a state law restricting use of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills. The suit asked the court to block the state law.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit named as defendants some Democrats, including North Carolina's attorney general. Representatives of the gynecologist said they couldn't say who is backing the litigation financially.\par \par \uc2 Also on Wednesday, GenBioPro Inc., a drugmaker that makes a generic form of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, sued West Virginia officials in federal court, arguing that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/west-virginia-passes-near-total-abortion-ban-11663107167"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 state's ban on the drug  }}}\uc2  violates the supremacy and commerce clauses of the Constitution.\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for North Carolina Attorney General \uc2 Josh Stein\uc2  said his office is reviewing the doctor's complaint. Defendant Jeff Nieman, district attorney for North Carolina's 18th prosecutorial district, said that he pledged publicly never to prosecute anyone for aiding in or receiving abortions but that it is common for his role to be named in such lawsuits.\par \par \uc2 West Virginia Attorney General Patrick Morrisey said his office would vigorously defend the state's new \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law. "While it may not sit well with manufacturers of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  drugs, the \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court\uc2  has made it clear that regulating \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a state issue," he said.\par \par \uc2 Other defendants in the suits didn't immediately return requests for comment.\par \par \uc2 The litigation kicks off a fresh round of fighting over the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, which has emerged as a new battleground between \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  supporters and opponents since the Supreme Court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned Roe v. Wade in June  }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone, also known as the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, works by blocking hormones necessary for pregnancy. It is \uc2 FDA\uc2  -approved for up to 10 weeks of pregnancy and is used with another drug called misoprostol that causes the uterus to contract.\par \par \uc2 Last November, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/lawsuit-filed-to-reverse-approval-access-to-abortion-pill-11668796816"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sued the FDA  }}}\uc2  and the \uc2 Health and Human Services Department\uc2  in a federal court in Texas, seeking to undo the approval of the pill.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month the \uc2 FDA\uc2  moved to expand access to the pill, allowing bricks-and-mortar pharmacies to dispense it in addition to a handful of mail-order pharmacies that had been permitted to make shipments.\par \par \uc2 North Carolina law requires that a patient receive counseling and wait 72 hours before returning to the prescriber in person to receive the pill.\par \par \uc2 Amy Bryant, an obstetrician-gynecologist who offers abortions and is affiliated with the UNC Health medical system, filed suit in the District Court for the Middle District of North Carolina against state officials who also include the state's secretary of health and human services.\par \par \uc2 Part of the mission of North Carolina's Health and Human Services is to ensure \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive health\b0 \highlight\uc2  services are accessible, said a spokeswoman, who said the agency will review the lawsuit once it receives it. The North Carolina Medical Board, whose members were also named as defendants, declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 Both the doctor's lawsuit and the GenBioPro suit argue that federal law pre-empts state laws, which the suits say {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/more-women-requesting-abortion-pills-outside-formal-channels-study-finds-11667316848"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 burden patients trying to get mifepristone  }}}\uc2 , in line with the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's approved conditions.\par \par \uc2 "State legislatures shouldn't be able to reverse \uc2 FDA\uc2  's decisions about what the appropriate mix of restrictions is," said Eva Temkin, a lawyer at the firm \uc2 King & Spalding\uc2  who is representing Dr. Bryant.\par \par \uc2 GenBioPro's suit was filed in the District Court for the Southern District of West Virginia and names a county prosecuting attorney and the attorney general as defendants.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  's legal authority might be fertile ground for activists seeking to undermine \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions, said Carl Tobias, a professor at the University of Richmond School of Law. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
