\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone is a drug that blocks a hormone needed for pregnancy and is \uc2 FDA\uc2  -approved for use up to 10 weeks in pregnancy. PHOTO: Natalie Behring for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 Walgreens Boots Alliance Inc\uc2  . is the first major national pharmacy chain to say it plans to dispense the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill under {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pills-to-be-available-more-widely-under-new-fda-rules-11672789765"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new rules laid out  }}}\uc2  by the \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 CVS Health Corp\uc2  . later said it would also sell the pill.\par \par \uc2 The new rules, issued Tuesday, allow any pharmacy to become certified to dispense mifepristone, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-is-an-abortion-pill-leaked-supreme-court-decision-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the drug that blocks a hormone  }}}\uc2  needed for pregnancy and is \uc2 FDA\uc2  -approved for use up to 10 weeks in pregnancy. Until the changes, the agency had allowed only a handful of mail-order pharmacies and certified doctors to hand out the drug.\par \par \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  on Wednesday didn't give a timetable for when it would start filling mifepristone. It said it would only do so in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal.\par \par \uc2 "We intend to become a certified pharmacy under the program," said a \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  spokesman. "We are working through the registration, necessary training of our pharmacists, as well as evaluating our pharmacy network in terms of where we normally dispense products that have extra \uc2 FDA\uc2  requirements and will dispense these consistent with federal and state laws."\par \par \uc2 After saying it was reviewing the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's new rules, CVS said it would also sell mifepristone.\par \par \uc2 "We plan to seek certification to dispense mifepristone where legally permissible," a CVS spokeswoman said.\par \par \uc2 Rite Aid Corp\uc2  . said it was still reviewing the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's changes.\par \par \uc2 Under the \uc2 FDA\uc2  rules, pharmacies that want to dispense the pill must become certified, promise they will only fill prescriptions from certified prescribers and make other plans to keep records and assure confidentiality.\par \par \uc2 Some independent pharmacies said Wednesday that they would like to become certified to dispense mifepristone, said Ronna Hauser, senior vice president of policy and pharmacy affairs for the \uc2 National Community Pharmacists Association\uc2  , which has 19,400 members.\par \par \uc2 She said the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's requirements for certification didn't seem overly burdensome and would be familiar to pharmacists who have signed up to dispense other drugs with special safety rules from the \uc2 FDA\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 "I think in those states where it will be allowed to be dispensed, I think our members will make a personal business decision," she said.\par \par \uc2 A move to fill mifepristone prescriptions could expose pharmacy stores to criticism from \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents. Students for Life Action, an antiabortion group, said it would consider protesting pharmacies that choose to dispense the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill.\par \par \uc2 "We are willing to bring to their doorsteps the kind of activism that has taken place outside of \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  vendors," a spokeswoman for the group said.\par \par \uc2 Women who want an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  via pill take {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/supreme-court-decision-roe-v-wade-6-24-2022/card/what-are-abortion-pills-and-how-widely-are-they-used--wEw3DtBAQMB1a8DJVQKQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mifepristone  }}}\uc2 , followed 24 to 48 hours later by misoprostol, a generic drug that causes uterine contractions. Many women have sought prescriptions, especially since the Supreme Court overturned {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/supreme-court-decision-roe-v-wade-6-24-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v. Wade  }}}\uc2 . Most abortions in the U.S. are now completed using the pills, according to the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2  , an organization that supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights and tracks \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  statistics.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14Laura Kusisto contributed to this article\par \par \uc2 Write to Liz Essley Whyte at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:liz.whyte@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liz.whyte@wsj.com  }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/walgreens-will-sell-the-abortion-pill-pharmacy-says-11672870977"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Walgreens Becomes First U.S. Pharmacy Chain to Say It Will Sell \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Pill  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230104ej140058x\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
