\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone, sold as a generic or under the brand name Mifeprex, is used in combination with misoprostol in a medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  regimen. PHOTO: Natalie Behring for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 The Food and Drug Administration expanded access to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-is-an-abortion-pill-leaked-supreme-court-decision-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drug that induces \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , allowing bricks-and-mortar pharmacies to dispense the pills for the first time.\par \par \uc2 Under the changes the agency issued Tuesday, any pharmacy can complete and sign a short form to become certified to provide the so-called \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, not just the handful of mail-order pharmacies that were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fda-allows-women-to-get-abortion-pill-by-mail-11639698022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 permitted to ship prescriptions  }}}\uc2  during the pandemic.\par \par \uc2 The moves won't change the availability of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for many women. A dozen states {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ban \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  throughout pregnancy  }}}\uc2 , and 18 require a physician to be physically present with a patient to prescribe \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills, effectively banning telehealth for abortions, according to the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2  , a nonprofit that tracks \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  statistics and supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 More doctors, however, may sign up to be certified {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/more-women-requesting-abortion-pills-outside-formal-channels-study-finds-11667316848"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to prescribe \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pills  }}}\uc2  because they will no longer need to stock and dispense the medication as well. Some women who are concerned a family member or roommate might open a mailed package of pills might feel more comfortable filling a prescription at a pharmacy.\par \par \uc2 The action will also likely deepen tensions between \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  supporters and opponents over access to the drug, which many women seeking to end their pregnancies have turned to, especially after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Supreme Court overturned Roe v. Wade  }}}\uc2  last year.\par \par \uc2 "At a time when people across the country are struggling to obtain \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -care services this modification is critically important to expanding access to medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services," said Danco Laboratories LLC, one of the companies that makes the pill. The \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, called mifepristone, is sold as a generic or under {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/little-known-abortion-pill-maker-faces-scrutiny-11656939602"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the brand name Mifeprex  }}}\uc2 . It is also sometimes known as RU-486. It works by blocking a hormone necessary to sustain pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Before the pandemic, women could get the pill only if they went to certain healthcare settings, such as a doctor's office. During the pandemic, the \uc2 FDA\uc2  allowed doctors to prescribe the pill via telehealth and allowed certified mail-order pharmacies to send it to patients.\par \par \uc2 The agency said in late 2021 that it would permit telehealth \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue permanently, though some states ban the practice.\par \par \uc2 Women seeking an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  by pill take mifepristone followed by misoprostol, which causes uterine contractions. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  says the regimen is safe and effective up to 10 weeks in pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Most abortions in the U.S. happen via the pill, according to the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2  . Several organizations that mail \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills, sometimes to women in states with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans, have seen shipments increase since the Supreme Court's latest \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  decision.\par \par \uc2 Aid Access, a nonprofit based in Europe that mails pills worldwide, even to states with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans, said it is receiving about 4,000 requests for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills a month from the U.S.\par \par \uc2 In addition to broadening access to bricks-and-mortar pharmacies, the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's action cemented its earlier decision to allow telehealth abortions. The agency ended a requirement that the pill must be prescribed in person and affirmed that mail-order pharmacies could dispense the medication if certified.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  made the latest changes to access to mifepristone by sending letters to manufacturers, approving their plans to alter the drugs' safety restrictions. The agency also updated a page on its website.\par \par \uc2 "This has been a niche product for so long, and now we're really on the cusp of making it mainstream," said Kirsten Moore, director of the Expanding Medication \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Access Project, a nonprofit that supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents said the changes should be rolled back. "State lawmakers and Congress must stand as a bulwark against the Biden administration's pro-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  extremism. We hope to see the \uc2 FDA\uc2  do its job to protect the lives of women and put an end to chemical abortions," said Marjorie Dannenfelser, president of SBA Pro-Life America, an antiabortion group.\par \par \uc2 Even before the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's moves, mifepristone was poised to be at the center of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  battles this year. Some state legislatures are expected to debate bills restricting or defending access to the drug. A Missouri bill, for example, would make bringing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -inducing drugs into the state a felony.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/lawsuit-filed-to-reverse-approval-access-to-abortion-pill-11668796816"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sued the FDA  }}}\uc2  in federal court late last year, seeking to overturn mifepristone's approval. Experts expect to see more lawsuits over potential conflicts between the \uc2 FDA\uc2  's power to regulate drugs and the states' power to regulate the practice of medicine.\par \par \uc2 Also on Tuesday, the Justice Department issued an opinion saying that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills can be sent through the U.S. mail, as long as the sender doesn't intend them to be used unlawfully.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. Postal Service\uc2  and the \uc2 Department of Health and Human Services\uc2  had asked the Justice Department to clarify an 1873 law, which had been invoked by Mississippi's attorney general in a lawsuit last year, that prohibits mailing items that can be used to produce abortions.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14Sadie Gurman contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Liz Essley Whyte at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:liz.whyte@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liz.whyte@wsj.com  }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pills-to-be-available-more-widely-under-new-fda-rules-11672789765"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Pills to Be Available More Widely Under New FDA Rules  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230103ej13005v5\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
