\par\par \uc2 Health News\par \uc2 Health\par \b \uc2 FDA\uc2  Makes Clear Plan B Emergency Contraceptive Isn't for  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 ; Agency revises label to make clear pill usually works before release of egg from ovary\b0\par\par\uc2 By Julie Wernau \par \uc2 515 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 December 2022\par 22:07 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Food and Drug Administration revised the label for the Plan B emergency-contraceptive pill to make clear it shouldn't be used for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Under the changes made Friday, the drug's label says the pill usually works before the release of an egg from an ovary.\par \par \uc2 "Do not use if you are already pregnant (because it will not work)," the label says.\par \par \uc2 Also known as the morning after pill, Plan B One-Step is composed of levonorgestrel, a synthetic hormone used in birth-control pills for more than 35 years, and is available over the counter. It is different from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-is-an-abortion-pill-leaked-supreme-court-decision-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 medication \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , known as Plan C, which can terminate a pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Use of Plan B increased after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Supreme Court overturned Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 , prompting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/cvs-walmart-limit-purchases-of-plan-b-pills-after-surge-in-demand-11656358819"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pharmacies to ration supplies }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  said it changed the label and information about the medication on its website in response to current science, which the agency said supports the conclusion that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fda.gov/drugs/postmarket-drug-safety-information-patients-and-providers/plan-b-one-step-15-mg-levonorgestrel-information"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Plan B works by inhibiting or delaying ovulation }}}\uc2 . "There is no direct effect on fertilization or implantation," the \uc2 FDA\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 "It's a huge relief that the \uc2 FDA\uc2  has changed the labeling so that it actually reflects what we know is scientifically true," said Michelle Brown, legislative chair for the Illinois chapter of the \uc2 American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists\uc2  and an OB-GYN at Northwestern Medicine.\par \par \uc2 Since {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-does-overturning-roe-v-wade-mean-explained-11656081705"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Supreme Court's \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  decision }}}\uc2 , several states {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fertility-doctors-move-embryos-to-other-states-in-case-of-roe-v-wade-impact-11656063000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have sought to enact legislation }}}\uc2  to confer "personhood rights" to fertilized eggs, embryos and fetuses.\par \par \uc2 Their moves raised concerns from \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  supporters and doctors that people would read the drug's label, which had said the pill could block fertilized eggs from implanting in the womb, to mean the drug effectively aborts a fertilized egg.\par \par \uc2 It also raised concerns that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/websites-selling-unapproved-abortion-pills-are-booming-11661079601"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 some women could mistakenly use the pills }}}\uc2  to try to self-manage abortions at home.\par \par \uc2 Yet researchers said there wasn't scientific evidence finding the pill can stop a fertilized egg from attaching to the womb. In 2013, health authorities in Europe revised the label for an identical drug to Plan B saying that there was no such evidence.\par \par \uc2 Under the \uc2 FDA\uc2 's changes, consumer leaflets for the pill will now say: "Plan B One-Step will not work if you are already pregnant and will not affect an existing pregnancy."\par \par \uc2 The change is the result of the \uc2 FDA\uc2 's review of Foundation Consumer Healthcare's 2018 application to alter the label for its product.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  said Plan B One-Step, when taken as directed within 72 hours after sex, prevents pregnancy by acting on ovulation well before implantation.\par \par \uc2 Unlike emergency contraception, medication abortions typically involve two medications\u8212\'20\'14mifepristone and misoprostol. Mifepristone blocks the hormone progesterone, which is needed to sustain a pregnancy. Misoprostol causes uterine contractions and bleeding.\par \par \uc2 Write to Julie Wernau at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:julie.wernau@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 julie.wernau@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fda-makes-clear-plan-b-emergency-contraceptive-isnt-for-abortion-11671829556"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FDA Makes Clear Plan B Emergency Contraceptive Isn't for \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020221223eicn005xx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
